535 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 1303 0 R
/T (Code Scope: The 3- and 5-qubit repetition codes protect against one error type at a time \(X or Z\), not general noise. Under mixed noise, no single code helped.)
/E (Code Scope: The 3- and 5-qubit repetition codes protect against one error type at a time \(X or Z\), not general noise. Under mixed noise, no single code helped.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
536 0 obj
